#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Button"
msgstr "Botó"

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Boolean Input"
msgstr "Casella booleana"

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
#. The [l] tag turns into an icon of a mouse with the left button pressed
msgid "[l] toggle value, or drop a reporter into it."
msgstr "[l] commuta'n el valor, o deixa-hi caure un reportador."

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Color Input"
msgstr "Casella de color"

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
#. The [l] tag turns into an icon of a mouse with the left button pressed
msgid "[l] change the color, or drop a reporter into it."
msgstr "[l] canvia'n el color, o deixa-hi caure un reportador."

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Input"
msgstr "Entrada"

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
#. The [l] tag turns into an icon of a mouse with the left button pressed
msgid "[l] edit its value, or drop a reporter into it."
msgstr "[l] edita'n el valor, o deixa-hi caure un reportador."

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Block Extension"
msgstr "Fletxa d'ampliació"

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
#. The [l] tag turns into an icon of a mouse with the left button pressed
msgid "[l] right arrow to show optional inputs, left arrow to hide."
msgstr "[l] sobre la fletxa que apunta a la dreta per mostrar caselles opcionals, i sobre la que apunta a l'esquerra per amagar-les."

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Command Block"
msgstr "Bloc comanda"

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Hat Block"
msgstr "Bloc de barret"

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
#. The [l] tag turns into an icon of a mouse with the left button pressed
#. The [r] tag turns into an icon of a mouse with the right button pressed
msgid "[l] to run, or drag to build scripts. [r] menu."
msgstr "[l] per execuitar-lo, o arrosega'l per construir programes. [r] menú."

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Reporter Block"
msgstr "Bloc reportador"

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
#. The [l] tag turns into an icon of a mouse with the left button pressed
#. The [r] tag turns into an icon of a mouse with the right button pressed
msgid "[l] to see value, or drop into an input slot. [r] menu."
msgstr "[l] per consultar-ne el valor, o deixa'l caure dins d'una casella. [r] menú."

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Script"
msgstr "Programa"

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
#. The [l] tag turns into an icon of a mouse with the left button pressed
#. The [r] tag turns into an icon of a mouse with the right button pressed
msgid "[l] to run. [r] menu."
msgstr "[l] per executar-lo. [r] menú."

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Pane Divider"
msgstr "Divisor d'àrea"

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Drag to change pane width."
msgstr "Arrossega'l per canviar l'amplada de l'àrea."

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Library"
msgstr "Biblioteca"

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
#. The [l] tag turns into an icon of a mouse with the left button pressed
#. The [r] tag turns into an icon of a mouse with the right button pressed
msgid "[l] to show the blocks in this library. [r] menu."
msgstr "[l] per mostrar els blocs d'aquesta biblioteca. [r] menú."

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Block Category"
msgstr "Categoria de blocs"

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
#. The [l] tag turns into an icon of a mouse with the left button pressed
msgid "[l] to show the blocks in this category."
msgstr "[l] per mostrar els blocs d'aquesta categoria."

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Palette"
msgstr "Paleta"

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Drag blocks from here to build scripts. Drop scripts here to delete them."
msgstr "Arrossega blocs des d'aquí fins a la zona de programació per construir programes. Deixa-hi caure programes per eliminar-los."

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Scripts Pane"
msgstr "Àrea de programes"

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
#. The [r] tag turns into an icon of a mouse with the right button pressed
msgid "Drag blocks here to build scripts. [r] menu."
msgstr "Col·loca-hi blocs per construir programes. [r] menú."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Turn the user LED on or off."
msgstr "Encén o apaga del LED d'usuari."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Display a bubble showing the value."
msgstr "Mostra una bafarada amb el valor."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Graph the value."
msgstr "Afegeix el valor a la gràfica."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
#. The (o-) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to off, or false (red)
msgid "Report the state of button A ( (-o) or (o-) )."
msgstr "Reporta l'estat del botó A ( (-o) o (o-) )."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
#. The (o-) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to off, or false (red)
msgid "Report the state of button B ( (-o) or (o-) )."
msgstr "Reporta l'estat del botó B ( (-o) o (o-) )."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the milliseconds since the timer was last reset."
msgstr "Reporta els mil·lisegons des de l'última inicialització del temporitzador."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Reset the timer."
msgstr "Inicialitza el temporitzador."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the seconds since power up."
msgstr "Reporta els segons des que la placa s'ha engegat."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the milliseconds since power up."
msgstr "Reporta els mil·lisegons des que la placa s'ha engegat."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the microseconds since power up."
msgstr "Reporta els microsegons des que la placa s'ha engegat."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the board type."
msgstr "Reporta el tipus de placa."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Reports firmware version loaded on the board."
msgstr "Reporta la versió del firmware carregat a la placa."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Reports the three-letter BLE ID of the board if it supports BLE."
msgstr "Reporta l'identificador BLE de tres caràcters de la placa, si suporta BLE."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Reports (-o) if a BLE client is connected."
msgstr "Reporta (-o) si hi ha un client BLE connectat."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the milliseconds since the given start milliseconds. Handles clock wrap."
msgstr "Reporta els mil·lisegons des del moment d'inici especificat."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the microseconds since the given start microseconds. Handles clock wrap."
msgstr "Reporta els microsegons des del moment d'inici especificat."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Reports (-o) if the board is connected to IDE."
msgstr "Reporta (-o) si la placa està connectada a la IDE."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
#. The (o-) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to off, or false (red)
msgid "Report the electrical logic level on a digital pin ( (-o) or (o-) )."
msgstr "Reporta el nivell lògic elèctric en un pin digital ( (-o) o (o-) )."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report a number proportional to the voltage on an analog pin (0 = ground, 1023 = supply voltage)."
msgstr "Reporta un nombre proporcional al voltatge en un pin analògic (0 = terra, 1023 = voltatge subministrat)."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
#. The (o-) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to off, or false (red)
msgid "Turn a pin on or off ( (-o) or (o-) )."
msgstr "Activa o desactiva un pin digital ( (-o) o (o-) )."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Pulse width modulate (PWM) a pin with the given duty cycle (0 - 1023)."
msgstr "Modula per amplada de polsos (PWM) un pin amb un cicle de treball determinat (0 - 1023)."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report number of analog pins on this device."
msgstr "Reporta el número de pins analògics en aquest dispositiu."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report number of digital pins on this device."
msgstr "Reporta el número de pins digitals en aquest dispositiu."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the value of a register (0-255) of an I2C device (0-127)."
msgstr "Reporta el valor d'un registre (0-255) d'un dispositiu I2C (0-127)."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Set an I2C device and register to given value (0-255)."
msgstr "Fixa un dispositiu i registre I2C a un valor determinat (0-255)."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Receive multiple bytes from an I2C device."
msgstr "Rep múltiples bytes d'un dispositiu I2C."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Send multiple bytes to an I2C device."
msgstr "Envia múltiples bytes a un dispositiu I2C."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Send a byte (0-255) to an SPI device."
msgstr "Envia un byte (0-255) a un dispositiu SPI."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Read a byte from an SPI device while sending a zero byte. Report the byte received."
msgstr "Llegeix un byte d'un dispositiu SPI, i envia un byte zero. Reporta el byte rebut."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Set the SPI clock speed, mode, channel (Raspberry Pi only), and bit order."
msgstr "Ajusta la velocitat del rellotge, mode, canal (només per a Raspberry Pi) i ordre de bits del bus SPI."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Send a byte array via SPI, replacing its contents with the bytes received."
msgstr "Envia una llista de bytes per SPI, substituint els seus continguts pels bytes rebuts."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Open the serial port at the given baud rate."
msgstr "Obre el port sèrie a la velocitat en bauds especificada."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Close the serial port."
msgstr "Tanca el port sèrie."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report data received from the serial port (a byte array)."
msgstr "Reporta les dades rebudes pel port sèrie (una llista de bytes)."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Send a byte array to the serial port."
msgstr "Envia una llista de bytes pel port sèrie."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Send a byte array to the serial port, starting at the given byte."
msgstr "Envia una llista de bytes pel port sèrie, començant pel byte especificat."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Write a byte to the pin at the specified baud rate."
msgstr "Envia un byte al pin amb la taxa de bauds especificada."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Run when the board powers up or when the IDE start button is clicked."
msgstr "Executa quan la placa s'engegui o en clicar al botó d'inici de l'editor."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Run when buttons A, B, or A+B are pressed."
msgstr "Executa quan es premin els botons A, B, o tots dos alhora."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Repeat the enclosed blocks indefinitely."
msgstr "Repeteix l'execució dels blocs que conté, contínuament."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Repeat the enclosed blocks the given number of times."
msgstr "Repeteix l'execució dels blocs que conté, el nombre de vegades especificat."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Wait the given number of milliseconds."
msgstr "Espera el nombre de mil·lisegons especificat."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Run the first set of blocks whose test condition is (-o) ."
msgstr "Executa el primer grup de blocs pels quals la condició sigui (-o) ."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Run when the condition becomes (-o) ."
msgstr "Executa quan la condició esdevingui (-o) ."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Wait until the condition becomes (-o) ."
msgstr "Espera fins que la condició sigui (-o) ."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Return (report) the given value from a function or script."
msgstr "Retorna (reporta) el valor especificat des d'una funció o programa."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Run when the given message is received as a broadcast."
msgstr "Executa quan es rebi el missatge especificat."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Broadcast the given message."
msgstr "Emet el missatge especificat."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Do nothing. Used to add notes and documentation."
msgstr "No fa res. S'utilitza per afegir notes i documentació."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report a list containing the given range of numbers (with optional increment). Useful in \"for\" loops."
msgstr ""
"Reporta una llista que conté el rang de nombres definit (amb increment "
"opcional). Útil en bucles \"per\"."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Repeat the enclosed blocks with the variable set to the current iteration number or item."
msgstr "Repeteix l'execució dels blocs que conté, fixant la variable a l'element o número de l'interval corresponent en cada iteració."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Repeat the enclosed blocks until the condition becomes (-o) ."
msgstr "Repeteix l'execució dels blocs que conté, fins que la condició esdevingui (-o) ."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Stop this task."
msgstr "Atura aquesta tasca."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Stop all tasks except this one."
msgstr "Atura totes les tasques excepte aquesta."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Wait the given number of microseconds."
msgstr "Espera el nombre de microsegons especificat."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the last broadcast message received."
msgstr "Reporta l'últim missatge emès i rebut."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the given argument or defaultValue if the argument was not supplied by the caller."
msgstr ""
"Dins una funció, reporta l'argument indicat per l'índex, o un valor per "
"defecte si aquest argument no s'ha proporcionat."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Call the function with the given name and optional parameter list."
msgstr "Executa la funció amb el nom especificat amb la llista de paràmetres opcional proporcionada."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Call the function with the given name and optional parameter list and report its return value."
msgstr "Crida la funció amb el nom especificat amb la llista de paràmetres opcional proporcionada, i reporta'n el valor de retorn."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the sum of the given numbers."
msgstr "Reporta la suma dels nombres especificats."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the first number minus the second."
msgstr "Reporta la resta entre el primer i el segon nombre."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the product of the given numbers."
msgstr "Reporta el producte dels números especificats."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the first number divided by the second."
msgstr "Reporta el resultat de dividir el primer nombre entre el segon."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the remainder of dividing the first number by the second."
msgstr "Reporta el residu de dividir el primer nombre entre el segon."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the absolute value of the given number (always >= 0)."
msgstr "Reporta el valor absolut del nombre especificat (sempre >= 0)."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the minimum of the values."
msgstr "Reporta el més petit dels valors especificats."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the maximum of the values."
msgstr "Reporta el més gran dels valors especificats."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report a randomly chosen number in the given range."
msgstr "Reporta un nombre a l'atzar dins el rang especificat."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Report (-o) if the first value is less than the second one."
msgstr "Reporta (-o) si el primer valor és menor que el segon."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Report (-o) if the first value is less than or equal to the second one."
msgstr "Reporta (-o) si el primer valor és menor o igual que el segon."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Report (-o) if the two values are equal."
msgstr "Reporta (-o) si els dos valors són iguals."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Report (-o) if the two values are not equal."
msgstr "Reporta (-o) si els dos valors són diferents."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Report (-o) if the first value is greater than or equal to the second one."
msgstr "Reporta (-o) si el primer valor és major o igual que el segon."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Report (-o) if the first value is greater than the second one."
msgstr "Reporta (-o) si el primer valor és major que el segon."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
#. The (o-) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to off, or false (red)
msgid "Boolean constant ( (-o) or (o-) )."
msgstr "Constant booleana ( (-o) o (o-) )."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
#. The (o-) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to off, or false (red)
msgid "Report the logical inverse of a Boolean ( (-o) or (o-) ) value."
msgstr "Reporta la inversa d'un valor booleà ( (-o) o (o-) )."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Report (-o) if both values are (-o)"
msgstr "Reporta (-o) si els dos valors són (-o)"

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Report (-o) if either value is (-o)"
msgstr "Reporta (-o) si algun dels dos valors és (-o)"

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Report (-o) if first input is a value of the given data type."
msgstr "Reporta (-o) si la primera casella té un valor del tipus especificat."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Convert a value to the given data type."
msgstr "Converteix un valor al tipus de dades especificat."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "If the condition is (-o) report the first alternative otherwise report the second alternative."
msgstr "Si la condició és (-o) reporta la primera alternativa, si no, reporta la segona alternativa."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Map a value in the \"from\" range to the corresponding value in the \"to\" range."
msgstr ""
"Transforma un nombre des del seu rang original fins al seu valor "
"corresponent en un altre rang."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the numerical value of a hexadecimal string (range: -0x1FFFFFFF to 0x1FFFFFFF)"
msgstr "Retorna el valor numèric decimal d'una cadena de text hexadecimal (rang: -0x1FFFFFFF a 0x1FFFFFFF)"

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report bitwise AND of two numbers."
msgstr "Reporta l'operació bit a bit \"i\" (AND) entre dos nombres."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report bitwise OR of two numbers."
msgstr "Reporta l'operació bit a bit \"o inclusiva\" (OR) entre dos nombres."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report bitwise XOR (exclusive OR) of two numbers."
msgstr "Reporta l'operació bit a bit \"o exclusiva\" (XOR) entre dos nombres."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report bitwise inverse of the given number."
msgstr "Reporta l'inversa bit a bit del nombre especificat."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the given number shifted left by the given number of bits."
msgstr "Reporta el nombre especificat desplaçat aritmèticament cap a l'esquerra el nombre de bits especificat."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the given number shifted right by the given number of bits (arithmetic shift; sign is maintained)."
msgstr "Reporta el nombre especificat desplaçat aritmèticament cap a la dreta el nombre de bits especificat."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Set a variable to the given value."
msgstr "Posa el valor especificat a una variable."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Change a variable by the given amount."
msgstr "Canvia el valor d'una variable en la quantitat especificada."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Create a variable local to the containing script with the given initial value."
msgstr "Crea una variable local al programa que la contingui i assigna-li un valor inicial."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the Nth item of a list, string, or byte array."
msgstr "Reporta l'element en la posició especificada d'una llista, cadena de text o llista de bytes."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the number of items in a list, string, or byte array."
msgstr "Reporta el nombre d'elements d'una llista, cadena de text o llista de bytes."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Join (concatenate) the given lists, strings, or byte arrays and report the result."
msgstr "Reporta la unió (concatenació) de les llistes, cadenes de text o llistes de bytes especificades."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Create and report a short list containing the given items. Length limited by available stack space."
msgstr "Crea i reporta una llista amb els elements especificats. La llargada de la llista està limitada a l'espai disponible a la pila."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Add an item to the end of a list."
msgstr "Afegeix un element al final d'una llista."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Replace the Nth item (or all items) of a list or byte array with the given value."
msgstr "Substitueix l'element en la posició especificada (o tots els elements) d'una llista o llista de bytes pel nou valor especificat."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Delete the Nth item (or all items) of a list."
msgstr "Elimina l'element en la posició especificada (o tots els elements) d'una llista."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Find and report the index of an item in a list or a substring within a string. Report -1 if not found."
msgstr "Cerca i reporta la posició d'un element en una llista, o una cadena de text dins d'una altra. Reporta -1 si no s'hi troba."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report a copy from the given index through the end (or optional stop index) of the given list, string, or byte array."
msgstr "Reporta una còpia d'una llista, cadena de text o llista de bytes a partir de la posició d'inici especificada i fins al final (o fins la posició final opcional especificada)."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Split the given string with the given delimiter and report the result (a list of strings)."
msgstr "Retorna la cadena de text especificada dividida pels delimitadors especificats (una llista de cadenes de text)."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Combine the items of a list into a string, optionally separated by a delimiter (e.g. comma)."
msgstr "Combina els elements d'una llista en una cadena de text, opcionalment separats per un delimitador (com ara una coma)."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the Unicode value (\"code point\") of the Nth character of the given string."
msgstr "Reporta el valor Unicode del caràcter en la posició especificada d'una cadena de text."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report a string containing the given Unicode value (\"code point\") or list of values."
msgstr "Reporta una cadena de text formada pel valor o llista de valors Unicode especificats."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report a new list of the given length filled with zero or the optional value."
msgstr "Reporta una nova llista de la mida especificada que contingui zeros (o el valor opcional especificat) en totes les seves posicions."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report a new byte array of the given length filled with zero or the optional value."
msgstr "Reporta una nova llista de bytes de la llargada especificada que contingui zeros (o el valor opcional especificat) en totes les seves posicions."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report a byte array containing the UTF-8 bytes of the given string."
msgstr "Reporta una llista de bytes que contingui els bytes UTF-8 de la cadena de text especificada."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the number of words of memory available. Stop button frees up memory."
msgstr "Reporta el número de paraules (grups de 32 bits, o 4 bytes) de memòria disponibles."

